{"type":"text","timestamp":1789888157066,"sessionID":"ses_f42685812ffeYBxHvYBLR3HFUo","part":{"id":"prt_0bda5ad67001my18FpgpYdb0M2","messageID":"msg_0bda57a74001enNH4EhJ85ovxK","sessionID":"ses_f42685812ffeYBxHvYBLR3HFUo","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Generate the interactive comprehensive exam question bank (`questions.json`) for exam `pwso6i7z2c08kk` (\"PAGPAG-REVIEWER\") in the Auto Exam Maker web app at `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project`.\n- Base all questions strictly on the Filipino reviewer `source.txt` (\"Pagbasa at Pagsusuri ng Iba't Ibang Teksto\"), following the `interactive-comprehensive-exam-generator` skill, so `exam.php`/`api/data.php` can render the exam.\n\n## Important Details\n- Output schema (from worker.php / existing `enaxqoqxb74s4g\\questions.json`): `{title, subject, summary, chapters:[{chapterId, title, description, questions:[{id, question, choices[4], correctAnswer 0-3, explanation}]}], encyclopedia:[{chapterId, term, definition}]}`.\n- Questions must be in Filipino (source language). Exactly 4 choices, one correct, plausible distractors, balanced A/B/C/D distribution per chapter, no answer-pattern leakage (avoid repeating sequences like D,B,A,C).\n- Job `pwso6i7z2c08kk` is stuck at `{\"status\":\"running\",...}` with no `questions.json` produced; worker's normal opencode invocation did not complete. Status must be flipped to `done` (status.json + SQLite `exams` row in `data/exam.db`) after the bank is validated, otherwise `exam.php` returns 409.\n- Approach: fragments written as one JSON block per chapter into `C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\pwso_frags\\`, then merged into `data/exams/pwso6i7z2c08kk/questions.json` (plan: small PHP merge via `C:\\xampp\\php\\php.exe`, then validate).\n- Chapter plan: ch1 ≈28, ch2 ≈26, ch3 ≈28, ch4 ≈28, ch5 ≈28, ch6 ≈14 (thin chapter), ch7 ≈28, ch8 ≈26, plus encyclopedia entries (≈10+ per chapter) and top-level `title`/`subject`/`summary`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Read source (8 chapters extracted), app architecture understood, schema confirmed from prior exam `enaxqoqxb74s4g`.\n- Todo list created (12 items).\n- `ch1.json` written (28 Qs); fixed stray trailing comma in ch1-q24 explanation.\n- `ch2.json` written (26 Qs).\n- `ch3.json` written (28 Qs); fixed typo \"hay\"→\"hayop\" in ch3-q24 explanation.\n- `ch4.json` written (28 Qs).\n- `ch5.json` written (28 Qs).\n- `ch6.json` written as 6 Qs, then Q7–Q14 appended via edit (14 total).\n- `ch7.json` written as 16 Qs, then Q17–Q28 (logical fallacies) appended via edit (28 total).\n- Letter distribution verified balanced for ch2 (7/6/7/6), ch3 (7/7/7/7), ch4 (7/7/7/7), ch5 (7/7/7/7), ch7 (7/7/7/7, fallacies reshuffled to avoid repeating pattern; ch1 also 7/7/7/7).\n\n### Active\n- Drafting Chapter 8 (VIII. Tekstong Prosidyural) fragment `ch8.json` (~26 Qs) — content available: Kahulugan (kronolohikal na ayos), Anim na Elemento, Apat na Bahagi (Target na Awtput, Mga Kagamitan, Metodo, Ebalwasyon), Paalala sa Paggawa, halimbawa (\"Paano gumawa ng adobong manok?\", \"Hakbang sa paggawa ng sulating pananaliksik\").\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write `C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\pwso_frags\\ch8.json` (~26 questions, balanced letters).\n2. Write encyclopedia fragment(s) and meta fragment (`title: \"PAGPAG-REVIEWER\"` or chapter-derived title, `subject`, `summary`) into the fragments dir.\n3. Create and run a PHP merge script (`C:\\xampp\\php\\php.exe`) that combines fragments into `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\pwso6i7z2c08kk\\questions.json`.\n4. Validate with PHP `json_decode`: 4 choices, `correctAnswer` 0–3, non-empty explanations, unique ids, valid chapter references in encyclopedia.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\pwso6i7z2c08kk\\source.txt`: authoritative reference (357 lines, 8 chapters).\n- `C:\\Users\\kelly\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\opencode\\pwso_frags\\ch1.json` … `ch7.json`: drafted chapter fragments (ch8 pending).\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\pwso6i7z2c08kk\\questions.json`: target output file (to create).\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\pwso6i7z2c08kk\\status.json` + SQLite `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exam.db`: must be updated to status `done` only after validated.\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\worker.php`, `api\\data.php`, `exam.php`, `lib\\db.php`: schema/status contract the bank must satisfy.\n- `C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\automation\\side-project\\data\\exams\\enaxqoqxb74s4g\\questions.json`: working schema example.\n- `C:\\xampp\\php\\php.exe`: PHP binary for the merge/validation step.","time":{"start":1789888146791,"end":1789888157044}}}
